1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,460
(Sheldon:)It'll take two weeks.

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:03,790
(Penny:)Leonard, are you okay?

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,330
(Leonard:)Um, I'm not sure.

4
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:07,570
(Howard:)What's going on?

5
00:00:07,570 --> 00:00:10,800
(Leonard:)Well, Mrs. Latham said
she was seriously considering

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,970
(Leonard:)donating money so we could get
a cryogenic centrifugal pump...

7
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:15,510
(Howard:)Yes!
Oh, wow!

8
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:18,410
(Leonard:)...then she stuck
her tongue down my throat.

9
00:00:18,410 --> 00:00:21,080
(Leonard:)Why?

10
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,650
(Penny:)Okay, we can't keep
explaining everything.

11
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:24,250
(Penny:)Read that book
we got you.

12
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:27,820
(Leonard:)She hit on me.

13
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:29,220
(Howard:)Wait-wait-wait.
Are you telling us

14
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:31,690
(Howard:)that old lady wanted
to have sex with you

15
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:35,420
(Howard:)in exchange for giving your
department millions of dollars?

16
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:36,630
(Leonard:)I think so.

17
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:38,890
(Howard:)You lucky duck.

18
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:43,430
(Penny:)You're really
a broken toy, aren't you?

19
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:45,770
(Leonard:)I was able to get out of there
before anything else happened,

20
00:00:45,770 --> 00:00:47,570
(Leonard:)but she wants to see me again
tomorrow night.

21
00:00:47,570 --> 00:00:50,300
(Mrs Latham:)Excellent!
What are you planning to wear?

22
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:51,910
(Leonard:)What?

23
00:00:51,910 --> 00:00:55,440
(Sheldon:)Penny, you're an expert on trading
sexual favors for material gain--

24
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:58,110
(Sheldon:)walk him through this.

25
00:00:58,110 --> 00:01:02,050
(Leonard:)Well, n-no, hold on a second,
I'm not going to sleep with her.

